    "created_at": "2021-04-21T11:42:01Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-04-21T11:42:01Z",
    "body": "> My gut feeling here would be that what's exposed to/announced by AT should match the visible counter\r\n\r\nAgreed.\r\n\r\nWhen an author chooses a counter type and start/increment number, they generally expect it to be conveyed consistently so they can reference it both online and offline. I have worked with attorneys who are very particular about the counters and start positions.",
