    "body": "Here's a demo: http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/9198\r\n\r\nWith Chrome and VoiceOver, it announces the rendered marker and also which list item you're on (in document order) and the total number of list items:\r\n\r\n```\r\nList 2 items\r\n2. Using the reversed attribute 1 of 2\r\n1. foo 2 of 2\r\nend of list\r\n```\r\n\r\nWith upper roman markers it announces them as:\r\n\r\n```\r\nI.\r\nTwo.\r\nThree.\r\nIV.\r\nV.\r\n```",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
